QuestGuidance.Register("en",45,{
[1409]="7006C6EC\n1\tMeet with Ashâmi near the serval den east of Urmâkh\tAshâmi was attacked by a serval and gravely wounded in her youth. She asks for your help against the diseased serval she is tasked to kill to prove herself to Numûru. The serval camp is east of Urmâkh.\n2\tComplete Instance: Ashâmi's Challenge\tAshâmi greeted you when you arrived outside of the serval den near Urmâkh. She waits for you to say you are ready to assist in hunting the diseased serval, Kanagir.\n3\tTalk to Ashâmi\tAshâmi completed her task at Tir Katar. Return to her home in Urmâkh and discuss her next steps.\n",
[1410]="70057724\n1\tPick up the Summoning Horn\tUse the Summoning Horn to call Frethi to your side.\n2\tTalk to Frethi\tFrethi is standing by inside Askâd-mazal. You should talk to Frethi\n3\tDefeat the Shadowed King\tDefeat the Shadowed King.\n",
[1411]="70057725\n1\tDefeat the Shadowed King\tDefeat the Shadowed King.\n",
[1412]="70057728\n1\tDefeat the Shadowed King\tDefeat the Shadowed King.\n",
[1413]="70057726\n1\tDefeat the Shadowed King\tDefeat the Shadowed King.\n",
[1414]="7005B115\n1\tDefeat Orcs and goblins at Atrad-zarakh (total: 12)\030Defeat bats at Atrad-zarakh (total: 8)\030Destroy crates of sapper-bombs at Atrad-zarakh (total: 6)\tOrcs, goblins, bats, and sapper-bomb crates can be found at Atrad-zarakh. King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Atrad-zarakh. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.\n2\tRaise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh\tYou have done much to hinder the Orcs and their vile allies at Atrad-zarakh. You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Atrad-zarakh.\n",
[1415]="7001B73C\n1\tAssault on Audaghaim\t\n",
[1416]="700375C3\n1\tBring Thane Ordlac's recommendation to Reeve Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should bring Thane Ordlac's recommendation to Reeve Fríthild's attention.\n2\tTalk to Reeve Fríthild\tReeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. You should speak with Reeve Fríthild regarding the recent battle at Bardh-dorám.\n",
[1417]="7005B50C\n1\tTalk to Múta\tShúkurz has returned with a wealth of information. You should talk to Múta and formulate a plan.\n2\tFind Dhúrstrok\tDhúrstrok is located in the catwalks north-east of Aslíf. The catwalks can be reached through the lift. Múta will meet you inside Dhúrstrok.\n3\tComplete 'Assault on Dhúrstrok' on any difficulty\tComplete 'Assault on Dhúrstrok' on any difficulty. Use the Instance Finder to enter Assault on Dhúrstrok.\n4\tTalk to Náin in Aslíf\tYou have rescued Náin and brought him back safely to Aslíf. You should talk to him.\n",
[1418]="7005B451\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tYou have found Dhúrstrok, Gorgar's stronghold. You should pick up the summoning horn to call Múta to your side.\n2\tFind Náin\tYou should find Náin's location. If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.\n3\tDefeat Gâdh-and-Shum\030Defeat Mozrúk the Wind-rider\tNáin is trapped behind a locked gate. Gorgar's generals, Gâdh-and-Shum and Mozrúk the Wind-rider, hold the keys. If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.\n4\tOpen the gate\tYou have obtained the keys needed to free Náin. You should return to the gate to unlock and open it. If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.\n5\tApproach Náin\tYou have unlocked and opened the gate to Náin's prison. You should approach him to make sure he has not suffered grave injuries. If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.\n6\tTalk to Múta\tMúta has something to say. If you need assistance, use the Call Múta skill to call Múta to your side. If you lose access to this skill, pick up the summoning horn at the instance entrance.\n",
[1419]="7005B453\n1\tFind Náin\tYou have found Dhúrstrok, Gorgar's stronghold. You should find Náin's location.\n2\tDefeat Gâdh-and-Shum\030Defeat Mozrúk the Wind-rider\tNáin is trapped behind a locked gate. Gorgar's generals, Gâdh-and-Shum and Mozrúk the Wind-rider, hold the keys.\n3\tOpen the gate\tYou have obtained the keys needed to free Náin. You should return to the gate to unlock and open it.\n4\tApproach Náin\tYou have unlocked and opened the gate to Náin's prison. You should approach him to make sure he has not suffered grave injuries.\n5\tTalk to Múta\tMúta has something to say.\n",
[1420]="7005B452\n1\tFind Náin\tYou have found Dhúrstrok, Gorgar's stronghold. You should find Náin's location.\n2\tDefeat Gâdh-and-Shum\030Defeat Mozrúk the Wind-rider\tNáin is trapped behind a locked gate. Gorgar's generals, Gâdh-and-Shum and Mozrúk the Wind-rider, hold the keys.\n3\tOpen the gate\tYou have obtained the keys needed to free Náin. You should return to the gate to unlock and open it.\n4\tApproach Náin\tYou have unlocked and opened the gate to Náin's prison. You should approach him to make sure he has not suffered grave injuries.\n5\tTalk to Múta\tMúta has something to say.\n",
[1421]="7005B450\n1\tFind Náin\tYou have found Dhúrstrok, Gorgar's stronghold. You should find Náin's location.\n2\tDefeat Gâdh-and-Shum\030Defeat Mozrúk the Wind-rider\tNáin is trapped behind a locked gate. Gorgar's generals, Gâdh-and-Shum and Mozrúk the Wind-rider, hold the keys.\n3\tOpen the gate\tYou have obtained the keys needed to free Náin. You should return to the gate to unlock and open it.\n4\tApproach Náin\tYou have unlocked and opened the gate to Náin's prison. You should approach him to make sure he has not suffered grave injuries.\n5\tTalk to Múta\tMúta has something to say.\n",
[1422]="7000E3DC\n1\tDefeat goblins in Goblin-town (total: 15)\tGoblins can be found in great numbers in the halls of Goblin-town in the Misty Mountains, far to the south and east of the North Downs. Handarod has asked you to defeat goblins in the depths of Goblin-town.\n2\tTalk to Handarod\tHandarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of the Misty Mountains. You should return to Handarod and tell him of your attack on Goblin-town.\n",
[1423]="70048C82\n1\tGo to Kala-gijak\tKala-gijak can be found in eastern Agarnaith. You should go to Kala-gijak.\n2\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron and the Red Sky Clan warriors are outside Kala-gijak, preparing to attack. You should meet up with Faeron.\n3\tComplete: A Foul Brew\030Complete: Disarming the Uruks\030Complete: Take Out the Look-outs\tKala-gijak can be found in eastern Agarnaith. You should complete missions for Faeron in Kala-gijak.\n4\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron and the Red Sky Clan warriors are outside Kala-gijak, preparing to attack. You should talk to Faeron.\n5\tDefeat Brogmaush\tBrogmaush can be found in the upper barracks of Kala-gijak. You should defeat Brogmaush with the aid of Faeron and Ghai-buri-Sêk.\n6\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron and the Drúedain have returned to the village of Bhol Rûdh. You should talk to Faeron.\n7\tTalk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr\tParsâ-dhug-Bhêr can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh. You should talk to Parsâ-dhug-Bhêr.\n",
[1424]="7006D1C3\n1\tDefeat Ordâkhai (total: 12)\030Destroy Ordâkhai provisions (total: 6)\tHamper the Ordâkhai efforts in Ambarûl by defeating soldiers and destroying their provisions in Khetsok.\n",
[1425]="7000AE17\n1\tDeliver the tokens of valour to First Marshal Án at the camp south of Tol Ascarnen\030Collect tokens of valour (total: 9)\tTokens of valour are bestowed at Glân Vraig. First Marshal Án is at the camp south of Tol Ascarnen. First Marshal Án wants to take the Tol Ascarnen back from the Enemy. He will not begin the assault until he knows that there are others who will stand with him. He told you to prove your worth by bringing him tokens of valour.\n",
[1426]="700381C4\n1\tDefend the east tower from the waves of attackers ([see journal]/14)\tLegolas is in need of aid in defending against a concentrated attack against the east tower. The Rohirrim labourers require protection as they construct their defensive barricades. The defenders will need your aid if they are to hold back the Orc assault. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[1427]="7001B732\n1\tClaim the Outer Bailey\tThe Outer Bailey holds the entrance to the Dungeons of Dol Guldur, but more importantly, the gates to the Inner Bailey and the heart of the fortress. All who stand guard must be cleared to claim this location.\n2\tHold the Outer Bailey against the assault\tThe forces of Dol Guldur will not give up their fortress so easily. Stand strong and defend what you have claimed from their wrath.\n3\tClaim the Inner Bailey\tThe Outer Bailey now belongs firmly to the Golden Host. It is time to push deeper and defeat those guarding the Inner Bailey.\n4\tHold the Inner Bailey against the assault\tYou have staked a claim for the Inner Bailey, but the masters of Dol Guldur will not give it up lightly. Defend it so that you may assault the Tower.\n5\tClaim the Ringwraiths' Lair\tThe warden of the Inner Bailey has come down from the tower. Defeat him and claim the baileys and outside of Dol Guldur for the Golden Host.\n",
[1428]="70029FBE\n1\tComplete 'Assault on the Ringwraiths' Lair' in a raid group\tTaking the baileys of Dol Guldur will leave the interior defences weak and vulnerable.\n",
[1429]="7001E98B\n1\tDefeat Orcs at Ânghum-maudhûl (total: 15)\tÂnghum-maudhûl lies to the south-east of Mithechad. Harchador has asked you to defeat the Orcs of Ânghum-maudhûl before they can muster their full strength.\n2\tTalk to Harchador at Mithechad\tHarchador is at Mithechad, north-west of Ânghum-maudhûl. You should speak with Harchador and let him know that you were victorious.\n",
[1430]="7002162D\n1\tFind cairn-stones (total: 3)\tThe ancient cairn-stones are located south of the Hall of Sanctuary, among the rolling hills and barrows. Lhudd has asked you to seek out ancient cairn-stones and place the amulet upon them. He believes that this may somehow help to mend the amulet.\n2\tTalk to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary\tLhudd is at the Hall of Sanctuary in the Lich Bluffs. You should return to Lhudd with news of your discoveries.\n",
[1431]="7003A5AB\n1\tCollect sacks in Underharrow (total: 6)\030Collect armour from barrels in Underharrow (total: 2)\tSacks and barrels of armour can be found throughout Underharrow in southern Kingstead. Ellen Fremedon has asked that you gather materials to aid in the defence of Underharrow. You should search for them in Underharrow.\n2\tAssemble warriors of Rohan at Underharrow (total: 6)\tSticks can be found along the southern border of Underharrow. Having gathered the components, you should now assemble warriors of Rohan to defend Underharrow using sticks placed near the settlement's edge.\n3\tTalk to Ellen Fremedon\tEllen Fremedon can be found outside the Mead Hall of Underharrow in southern Kingstead. You have built several warriors out of the materials Ellen suggested, and should now return to her.\n",
[1432]="7002710D\n1\tCall the scouts to Assembly\030Call the hunters to Assembly\030Call Maugan and the protectors to Assembly\tThe hunters are encamped to the south-east of Lhan Rhos. The scouts are encamped to the north-east of Lhan Rhos. The Protectors of the Pristine Glade are encamped to the west of Lhan Rhos. Speak to Maugan under the tree. He may need you to do additional work for him. Elder Déin has asked you to gather the people of the Dunbog for Assembly.\n2\tTalk to Elder Déin in Lhan Rhos\tThe Elders await your return at Lhan Rhos in the centre of the Dunbog. Having called the people of Dunbog to Assembly, you should return to the village and speak with Elder Déin.\n3\tTalk to Elder Dein\t\n",
[1433]="7002F83F\n1\tScout the northern den of Fang Point\030Scout the southern den of Fang Point\tFang Point is south of Feldburg, with two dens associated with the same pack: one to the north, and one to the south.. You should scout the north and south dens of Fang Point.\n2\tReturn to Captain Agelmund in Feldburg\tCaptain Agelmund awaits you at Feldburg in the Wold. You should return to Captain Agelmund with your assessment of the Wargs in Fang Point.\n",
[1434]="70037836\n1\tAssess the damage done to the overturned waggon\tThe road from Edoras to Aldburg sees much traffic, which makes it an attractive place for Orcs to attack. You should be wary as you journey to Aldburg and deal with any threats as they arise.\n2\tAssess the damage done to the overturned waggon\tThe road from Edoras to Aldburg sees much traffic, which makes it an attractive place for Orcs to attack. You should be wary as you journey to Aldburg and deal with any threats as they arise.\n3\tDefeat White Hand Orcs (total: 6)\tWhite Hand Orcs rush toward the overturned cart ready to attack. Defeat the White Hand attackers.\n4\tCompleted\tThis Orc-attack has been quelled, but it is only a matter of time before another one occurs. Nevertheless, you have made travel somewhat safer between Aldburg and Edoras.\n",
[1435]="70032BD9\n1\tMoria and White Hand Orcs are hard at work mining the ore here in the Redhorn and producing vast amounts of armour and weapons for their ranks. The White Hand Orcs have entrenched themselves in the northern half of the Redhorn Lodes, while the Moria Orcs struggle to keep the southern half.\t\n2\tFind Knakk's camp-site\tKnakk is located on the elevated platform just north of the White Hand Orcs' encampment, on the road toward the Grand Stair. Knakk is eager for any updates on the Orcs working so close to his hidden camp-site. It is vital that they remain unaware of his being there.\n",
[1436]="70067C40\n1\tCollect the report from Nimish\tGirgish instructed you to visit Guard Nimish at the southern entrance of the Jax Phanâl outpost. Guard Nimish regularly informs the emissary of goings on along the southern road. Today, Girgish would like you to fetch the guard's latest report.\n2\tDeliver the guard's report to Girgish\tNimish provided you a report on the latest movements by the Haradrim. Deliver the report to Girgish.\n",
[1437]="7006A954\n1\tFind the guard post in the sewers\tYou have been asked to check on a group of guards that were sent into the sewers beneath the Sail-haven. Their post can be found by entering Umbar-môkh through a door between The Wharf-gate and The Fisherfold.\n2\tTalk to Nashôn\tYou have been asked to check on a group of guards that were sent into the sewers. You should introduce yourself to Nashôn, who appears to be in charge.\n",
[1438]="700718EB\n1\tGather medicinal herbs (total: 5)\030Gather medicinal mushrooms (total: 3)\tMírthar is beginning to succumb to the blight and needs you to gather nearby medicinal herbs and mushrooms to make a healing concoction that can give him the strength he needs to get to Sul Madásh.\n2\tBring supplies to Mírthar\tYou have gathered the supplies that Mírthar requested. Return them to him so he can craft the needed concoction.\n",
[1439]="70009E80\n1\tDeliver the tokens to Goldhead\030Collect Tokens of Valour (total: 9)\tGoldhead is located at his den east and north of Tírith Rhaw. Goldhead requested that you bring proof of your loyalty and support of the cause of the Free Peoples in the Ettenmoors.\n",
[1440]="700585BE\n1\tCollect bat samples (total: 4)\tHórskur has asked for samples from the hostile bats in Tithzagáf, the cave on Grytholm. You can collect samples by defeating the bats and their masters.\n2\tDeliver bat samples to Hórskur\tYou have collected several bat samples for Hórskur, who is waiting outside of Tithzagáf.\n",
})
